0c-1 kelEPL fHSAwH"><h2 data-cy="category-ABOUT-title" font-size="32px" font-weight="normal" color="black.900" class="sc-1709896-0 bWUsCp">About</h2></div><hr class="sc-d0d050d8-0 hGzNES"/></div></div><section id="section-about" data-cy="section-about" class="sc-3340244f-0 iTPjmR"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 cIqaQH"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 eRmECd"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 jRaTqn"><div><div data-cy="longDescription" font-size="14px" class="sc-63bf996f-0 bKpumw sc-63bf996f-2 cBCMaS"><div>Biome is a toolchain for web projects; it aims to provide fast tools to maintain the said projects&#x27; healthy<br/><br/>Biome provides and owns all its tools: parser, formatter, analyzer, etc.<br/><br/>Biome is fast and reliable, it provides high-quality diagnostics, and it has its own LSP server out of the box. <br/><br/>Users can customise all the tools Biome provides with one configuration file.<br/><br/></div><blockquote><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> <em>“All contributions are donations. No goods or services are expected in return. Any requests for refunds for those purposes will be rejected.” </em></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-our-team" data-cy="section-our-team" class="sc-3340244f-0 eGKBUl"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 sc-7355880b-0 jyulmr"><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 uzGKt"><h2 font-weight="500" color="black.700" class="sc-dcb94ee2-0 sc-dcb94ee2-5 kmgLsS">Our team</h2><div class="sc-9ed2d16a-0 bGxwtX"><div width="144" height="auto" class="sc-2c35d607-0 sc-d82cae7-0 bfQJEs gMcYKv"><div class="sc-d82cae7-1 jfGyLV"><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 inLDtj"><a href="/arendjr"><div style="background-image:url(https://images.opencollective.com/arendjr/63bb437/avatar.png);background-size:cover" size="64" type="USER" src="https://images.opencollective.com/arendjr/63bb437/avatar.png" title="Arend" class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 kFsjOb cskNqH sc-ff045f41-0 iEGXco"></div></a></div></div><div class="sc-d3b1f0c-0 sc-d3b1f0c-1 iJlvnw hqNDzM"><a